{
  "id": "potv-water-pipe-adapter",
  "wp_id": 7622,
  "title": "POTV Water Pipe Adapter",
  "description": "Water Pipe Adapter for a variety of vaporizers\n\nConnect a number of popular vaporizers to your favorite bubbler with this water pipe adapter (see compatibility below). The universal design fits all 10, 14, and 18mm ground glass joints. This water pipe adapter is hot-swappable with our other ONE glass mouthpieces, even during a session.\n\nVapor enthusiasts have enjoyed water-conditioned vapor for years, cooling the vapor while also pulling out any bits of herbs that managed to sneak into the vapor. Using your vape with all your favorite glass pieces is easier than ever.\n\nMake your rig your own with a choice of colors:\n\nBlue: Elevate your vaping experience with the serene and elegant vibes of our blue glass.\n\nGreen: Allow the beauty of nature into your vaping session with our green glass.\n\nPink: Add a touch of elegance to your vaporizer with the gentle aura of our pink glass.\n\nPurple: Embrace a state of mindfulness with our intensely captivating purple glass.\n\nRed: Infuse your sessions with the vibrant and captivating energy of our red glass.\n\nCompatibility\n\nThis Water Pipe Adapter is compatible with:\n\nPlanet of the Vapes Lobo\n\nPlanet of the Vapes ONE\n\nPOTV XMAX V3 Pro\n\nPOTV Glass Adapter for V3 Pro\n\nPAX Glass Adapter\n\nMighty+ Glass Adapter\n\nCrafty+ Glass Adapter\n\nVolcano Glass Adapter\n\nReturn policy\n\nWe only accept returns for accessories if they are within 30 days, unused and unopened, or if they are being returned with a vaporizer under our 14-day satisfaction policy.",
  "description_html": "<h2><span>Water Pipe Adapter for a variety of vaporizers</span></h2>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Connect a number of popular vaporizers to your favorite bubbler with this water pipe adapter (see compatibility below).</span> The universal design fits all 10, 14, and 18mm ground glass joints. This water pipe adapter is hot-swappable with our other ONE glass mouthpieces, even during a session.</p>\n<p>Vapor enthusiasts have enjoyed water-conditioned vapor for years, cooling the vapor while also pulling out any bits of herbs that managed to sneak into the vapor. Using your vape with all your favorite glass pieces is easier than ever.</p>\n<h2><span>Make your rig your own with a choice of colors:</span></h2>\n<p><span><strong>Blue:</strong> Elevate your vaping experience with the serene and elegant vibes of our blue glass.</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Green:</strong> Allow the beauty of nature into your vaping session with our green glass.</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Pink:</strong><span> </span>Add a touch of elegance to your vaporizer with the gentle aura of our pink glass.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Purple:</strong><span> </span>Embrace a state of mindfulness with our intensely captivating purple glass.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><b>Red</b>: Infuse your sessions with the vibrant and captivating energy of our red glass.<strong></strong></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility</span></h2>\n<p><span>This Water Pipe Adapter is compatible with:</span></p>\n<p><a title=\"Planet of the Vapes Lobo Vaporizer\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/planet-of-the-vapes-lobo\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/planet-of-the-vapes-lobo\">Planet of the Vapes Lobo</a><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/planet-of-the-vapes-lobo\" title=\"Lobo\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/planet-of-the-vapes-lobo\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-one-vaporizer\" title=\"One\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-one-vaporizer\">Planet of the Vapes ONE </a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/xmax-v3-pro-vaporizer\" title=\"XMAX V3 Pro\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/xmax-v3-pro-vaporizer\">POTV XMAX V3 Pro</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"POTV Bubbler, Water Pipe &amp; Glass Accessory Adapter for V3 Pro\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-glass-adapter-v3-pro\">POTV Glass Adapter for V3 Pro</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-glass-accessory-adapter-for-pax\" title=\"PAX Glass Adapter Attachment\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-glass-accessory-adapter-for-pax\">PAX Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/mighty-mighty-plus-glass-adapter\" title=\"Mighty+ glass adapter\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/mighty-mighty-plus-glass-adapter\">Mighty+ Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/crafty-plus-glass-adapter\" title=\"Crafty+ Glass Adapter\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/crafty-plus-glass-adapter\">Crafty+ Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Volno Glass Adapter\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/volcano-glass-adapter\" data-mce-href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/volcano-glass-adapter\">Volcano Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<h2>Return policy</h2>\n<p>We only accept returns for accessories if they are within 30 days, unused and unopened, or if they are being returned with a vaporizer under our 14-day satisfaction policy.</p>",
